  ],
  "summary": "点开后按钮位置直接变成搜索框，输入即可模糊过滤选项；选中后回填并收起。",
  "usage": "选项较多（10 条以上）、用户已经知道要选什么：城市、成员、标签、项目名。",
  "caution": "选项少于 8 个时不需要搜索（普通下拉更快）；数据量极大要做远程搜索 + 防抖，不是本地过滤。",
  "hint": "点开后直接输入筛选",
  "prompt": "【可搜索下拉】目标：一个「选择城市」按钮，点开后**按钮所在的位置变成搜索框**，下方是选项列表；输入实时模糊过滤，点选项回填并收起。\n\n1) 结构：.wrap 内含 .trigger（默认）+ .searchBox（展开时显示，绝对定位在 trigger 位置）+ .panel（列表）。\n\n2) **按钮变搜索框**：展开时 `.trigger{visibility:hidden}`，`.searchBox` 出现在同一位置（同宽同高同圆角），里面是 input + 放大镜。位置不变、内容变了。\n\n3) **滚动条自绘**（详见「滚动条」设计）：\n```css\n.panel::-webkit-scrollbar{width:6px}\n.panel::-webkit-scrollbar-button{display:none;width:0;height:0}\n.panel::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:transparent;margin:7px 4px 7px 0}  /* 上下避圆角，右侧内缩 */\n.panel::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 32%,transparent);border-radius:999px}\n.panel::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 52%,transparent)}\n```\n   不要同时写 `scrollbar-width`/`scrollbar-color`（会让 Chromium 忽略 webkit 伪元素）；Firefox 兜底放 `@supports not selector(::-webkit-scrollbar)`。\n\n4) 自动聚焦：展开后 `input.focus({preventScroll:true})`（iframe 里裸 focus 会把外层设计库页面滚过来）；收起时清空输入、重置列表。\n\n5) 过滤：`indexOf` 模糊匹配；无结果显示「没有匹配项」空态。\n\n6) 键盘：Enter 选第一个、Esc 收起。\n\n7) 无障碍：trigger aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" + aria-expanded；input aria-label；列表 role=\"listbox\"，选项 role=\"option\" + aria-selected。\n\n8) 坑：展开时按钮用 `visibility:hidden` 保留占位；demo 的 `body{overflow:hidden}`，否则页面级滚动条会伪装成「面板滚动条」。\n\n9) 配色：选中项品牌色淡底 + 品牌色文字；右侧选中标记是**直线 SVG 对勾**（`.tick` 里放 `<svg>`，24 格 viewBox 折线 `<path d=\"M5.5 12.5l4.2 4.1 8.8-9.6\"/>`，尺寸 12px、stroke:currentColor、stroke-width 2.4、round linecap/linejoin，只在 .opt.on 时显示），不要用字体字符当勾。\n\n10) 自动演示：只在 !window.__uiInteractive 时循环（点按钮 → 搜索框出现 → 停留让滚动条露出来）。\n\n11) 使用场景：选项多（10+）、用户已知目标；少于 8 项用普通下拉；海量数据用远程搜索。写进 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;min-height:100vh;overflow:hidden;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:18px}\n\n.wrap{position:relative;width:190px}\n\n.trigger{width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:9px;\n  border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:var(--ui-surface);color:var(--ui-text);\n  font:inherit;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;\n  transition:border-color .15s ease,background .15s ease}\n.trigger:hover{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 45%,var(--ui-border))}\n.trigger span{flex:1;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}\n.trigger .chev{width:12px;height:12px;flex:0 0 auto;color:var(--ui-text-dim);transition:transform .2s ease}\n.wrap.open .trigger{visibility:hidden}\n\n.searchBox{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:none;align-items:center;gap:6px;\n  padding:0 12px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid var(--ui-brand);\n  background:var(--ui-surface);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 12%,transparent)}\n.wrap.open .searchBox{display:flex}\n.searchBox svg{width:12px;height:12px;flex:0 0 auto;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.searchBox input{flex:1;min-width:0;border:0;outline:0;background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text);\n  font:inherit;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:0}\n.searchBox input::placeholder{color:var(--ui-text-dim);font-weight:400}\n\n.panel{position:absolute;left:0;top:calc(100% + 8px);width:100%;max-height:118px;overflow:auto;\n  border-radius:11px;background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);\n  box-shadow:0 18px 44px color-mix(in srgb,#000 18%,transparent);\n  padding:5px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px;\n  opacity:0;transform:translateY(-4px);pointer-events:none;\n  transition:opacity .16s ease,transform .18s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1)}\n.wrap.open .panel{opacity:1;transform:none;pointer-events:auto}\n\n/* 自绘滚动条（同「滚动条」设计）：加宽 + 透明 border 内缩，track 上下避圆角 */\n.panel::-webkit-scrollbar{width:11px;height:11px}\n.panel::-webkit-scrollbar-button{display:none;width:0;height:0}\n.panel::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:transparent;margin:7px 0}\n.panel::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 32%,transparent);\n  border:3px solid transparent;border-right-width:4px;background-clip:padding-box;border-radius:999px}\n.panel::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 52%,transparent);background-clip:padding-box}\n.panel::-webkit-scrollbar-corner{background:transparent}\n@supports not selector(::-webkit-scrollbar){\n  .panel{scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--ui-text-dim) transparent}\n}\n\n.opt{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:7px 9px;border-radius:7px;border:0;\n  background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text);font:inherit;font-size:11px;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;\n  transition:background .13s ease,color .13s ease}\n.opt:hover{background:var(--ui-surface-2)}\n.opt.on{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 11%,transparent);color:var(--ui-brand);font-weight:600}\n.opt .tick{margin-left:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;opacity:0}\n.opt .tick svg{display:block;width:12px;height:12px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.4;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n.opt.on .tick{opacity:1}\n\n.empty{padding:12px;text-align:center;font-size:10px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  /* 小视口里按钮靠上，给下方展开的面板留空间：8 + 26 + 6 + 104 = 144 < 176，不会冒出 iframe 根滚动条 */\n  body{align-items:flex-start;padding:8px 10px 0}\n  .wrap{width:170px}\n  .trigger{font-size:10px;padding:6px 10px}\n  .panel{top:calc(100% + 6px);max-height:104px}\n  .panel::-webkit-scrollbar{width:10px}\n  .panel::-webkit-scrollbar-track{margin:5px 0}\n  .panel::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{border-width:2px;border-right-width:3px}\n  .opt{font-size:10px;padding:5px 8px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .trigger,.panel,.chev{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"wrap\" id=\"wrap\">\n  <button class=\"trigger\" id=\"trigger\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    <span id=\"label\">选择城市</span>\n    <svg class=\"chev\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 4.6 L6 7.4 L9 4.6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n  </button>\n\n  <div class=\"searchBox\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"6.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><path d=\"M16 16l4.5 4.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n    <input id=\"search\" type=\"text\" aria-label=\"搜索城市\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"输入城市名\">\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"panel\" id=\"panel\" role=\"listbox\" aria-label=\"城市\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var wrap = document.getElementById('wrap'),\n      trigger = document.getElementById('trigger'),\n      label = document.getElementById('label'),\n      panel = document.getElementById('panel'),\n      search = document.getElementById('search');\n\n  var CITIES = ['北京', '上海', '广州', '深圳', '杭州', '成都', '武汉', '西安', '南京', '重庆'];\n  var current = '';\n  var open = false;\n  var timer = null, cursor = null;\n\n  function focusNoScroll(el){\n    // 卡片 iframe 里裸 focus() 会让浏览器把父页面滚到这个 iframe，必须 preventScroll\n    try { el.focus({ preventScroll: true }); } catch(e){ /* 老浏览器忽略 */ }\n  }\n\n  function render(keyword){\n    var q = (keyword || '').trim();\n    panel.innerHTML = '';\n    var list = CITIES.filter(function(c){ return !q || c.indexOf(q) >= 0; });\n\n    if(!list.length){\n      var e = document.createElement('div');\n      e.className = 'empty';\n      e.textContent = '没有匹配项';\n      panel.appendChild(e);\n      return;\n    }\n\n    list.forEach(function(name){\n      var b = document.createElement('button');\n      b.className = 'opt' + (name === current ? ' on' : '');\n      b.type = 'button';\n      b.setAttribute('role', 'option');\n      b.setAttribute('aria-selected', name === current ? 'true' : 'false');\n      b.innerHTML = '<span>' + name + '</span><span class=\"tick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5.5 12.5l4.2 4.1 8.8-9.6\"/></svg></span>';\n      b.addEventListener('click', function(){\n        current = name;\n        label.textContent = name;\n        setOpen(false);\n      });\n      panel.appendChild(b);\n    });\n  }\n\n  function setOpen(on){\n    open = on;\n    wrap.classList.toggle('open', on);\n    trigger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', on ? 'true' : 'false');\n    if(on){\n      search.value = '';\n      render('');\n      setTimeout(function(){ focusNoScroll(search); }, 30);\n    } else {\n      search.value = '';\n    }\n  }\n\n  trigger.addEventListener('click', function(){ setOpen(!open); });\n  panel.addEventListener('click', function(e){ e.stopPropagation(); });\n\n  search.addEventListener('input', function(){ render(search.value); });\n  search.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\n    if(e.key === 'Enter'){\n      var first = panel.querySelector('.opt');\n      if(first) first.click();\n    } else if(e.key === 'Escape'){\n      setOpen(false);\n    }\n  });\n\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){ if(e.key === 'Escape') setOpen(false); });\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursor) return cursor;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n\n  function demo(){\n    setOpen(false);\n    current = '';\n    label.textContent = '选择城市';\n    render('');\n\n    var c = ensureCursor();\n    if(!c || !c.el) return;\n\n    c.el.classList.add('show');\n    c.moveTo(trigger);\n\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      c.press();\n      setTimeout(function(){\n        c.release();\n        setOpen(true);\n        setTimeout(function(){\n          c.moveTo(panel.querySelector('.opt'));\n          if(c.hide) c.hide();\n        }, 900);\n      }, 170);\n    }, 560);\n  }\n\n  function start(){\n    stop();\n    setTimeout(function(){ demo(); timer = setInterval(demo, 5000); }, 400);\n  }\n  function stop(){ if(timer){ clearInterval(timer); timer = null; } }\n\n  render('');\n  if(!window.__uiInteractive) start();\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>\n",
  "createdAt": 1794146368017,
  "updatedAt": 1794339399585
}